  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-18T17:22:06.335Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It is extremely useful to have the background log always enabled, especially when something unexpected happens in a world we develop which is difficult to reproduce. It would be hard to always remember to enable background logging. Additionally, it would be useful to have the log from the start in Build & Test mode without having to enable it and rejoin the world.\n\nA launch option is sufficient barrier to ensure that whoever enters it is okay with the performance penalty of having it enabled.",
